SUMMARY:Relief Printmaking with Heather Hogan
DESCRIPTION:Pence Adult Art Programs\nWith artist Heather Hogan\, students
  will learn how to design for relief printing\, transfer the design to the
  block\, use various types of ink\, and create single prints and repeating
  patterns on paper and fabric. Paper\, cards\, flour-sack towels\, and dra
 wstring pouches will be provided\, but students are encouraged to bring mu
 ltiple garments and fabrics to print upon. Tips and techniques for collagi
 ng paper prints and securing fabric printed patches to garments will be di
 scussed. This class is open to both beginners and experienced artists and 
 is recommended for ages 12 and up.\n\nRelief Printmaking with Heather Hoga
 n\nSunday\\\, August 9 \\| 10 AM \\- 1:30 PM\n$115 Members\, $125 Non-Memb
 ers (All materials included)\n\n**Registration is required through the [Pe
 nce's website (CLICK HERE)](https://pencegallery.org/education/programs/wo
 rkshops-and-classes/).**\n\nAny questions? Email pencegallery@gmail.com.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/pence-adult-art-programs/events/31517
 6714/
