DESCRIPTION:Intercultural Mosaics\n**Discover Intercultural Mosaics This S
 ummer 2026!**\n\nJoin us for a vibrant and uplifting season of virtual lea
 rning and community from **July 11 to August 29\, 2026**—all from the co
 mfort of your home on Zoom!\n\n**Bi-Weekly Friday Zoom Sessions** *(Every 
 2nd and 4th Friday)*\n• **4:00 PM** – Advanced Korean with Stephen\n
 • **5:00 PM** – Intermediate Conversational Chinese with Sam\n• **6:
 00 PM** – Bible Study & Meditation Group with Stephen\n• **7:00 PM** 
 – Beginning Chinese with Jane\n\n**Weekly Saturday Zoom Sessions** (tota
 l of 12 sessions)\n• **4:00 PM** – Beginning Spanish with Viviana\n•
  **6:00 PM** – Beginning to Intermediate Japanese with Norio\n• **7:00
  PM** – English Learners Group with Linda & Chad\n\n**Important Notes:**
 \nWe will resume our **regular in-person gatherings on September 12\, 2026
 ** at the **2nd floor rooms of Phoenix Hall\, Davis Community Church**.\n\
 nFor more information about Intercultural Mosaics classes and activities\,
  visit **[www.nextg.org](http://www.nextg.org)** or contact **Dr. Stephen 
 Moon** at **916-217-5470** or **catalyst@nextg.org**.
