DESCRIPTION:Demonstrate with the West Sacramento Action Circle Banner Brig
 ade and share the message of RESISTANCE! Mondays at 9:00 a.m. on the Harbo
 r Blvd. at Highway 50 Overpass Our giant banner displays a timely message 
 to: *Remind the public of our country’s current crisis *Suggest actions 
 we all can take *Publicize upcoming local resistance events *Let everyone 
 know they are not alone All peaceful participants are welcome to join in. 
